    {
      "source": "Creates a new <code>JpaOrder</code> instance. Takes a property path. Direction is <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Direction.html#ASC\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Direction.ASC</code></a> and\nNullHandling <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.NullHandling.html#NATIVE\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.NullHandling.NATIVE</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 <code>JpaOrder</code> 实例。接受一个属性路径。方向为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Direction.html#ASC\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Direction.ASC</code></a>，\n空值处理方式为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.NullHandling.html#NATIVE\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.NullHandling.NATIVE</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <code>JpaOrder</code> instance. Takes a single property. Direction is <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Direction.html#ASC\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Direction.ASC</code></a> and\nNullHandling <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.NullHandling.html#NATIVE\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.NullHandling.NATIVE</code></a>.",
