    {
      "source": "Creates a new <code>JpaOrder</code> instance. Takes a single property. Direction is <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Direction.html#DESC\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Direction.DESC</code></a> and\nNullHandling <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.NullHandling.html#NATIVE\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.NullHandling.NATIVE</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 <code>JpaOrder</code> 实例。接受单个属性参数，排序方向为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Direction.html#DESC\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Direction.DESC</code></a>，空值处理方式为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.NullHandling.html#NATIVE\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.NullHandling.NATIVE</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Custom <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Order.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Order</code></a> that keeps a flag to indicate unsafe property handling, i.e. the String provided is not\nnecessarily a property but can be an arbitrary expression piped into the query execution. We also keep an\nadditional <code>ignoreCase</code> flag around as the constructor of the superclass is private currently.",
      "translation": "自定义一个带有标记以指示不安全属性处理的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Order.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Order</code></a>类，即所提供的字符串不一定是属性，而可能是任意表达式并传入查询执行中。此外，由于当前父类的构造函数为私有，我们还需额外保留一个<code>ignoreCase</code>标记。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
